# `agents.dispatch`

Dispatch a single agent session (the canonical agent command).

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.runtime.dispatch`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `agent` | `string` |
| `spec` | `string` |
| `prompt` | `string` |
| `resume` | `bool` |
| `harness` | `string` |
| `model` | `string` |
| `open_tab` | `bool` |
| `invocation` | `string` |
| `keepalive` | `bool` |
| `workspace` | `string` |
| `slug` | `string` |
| `branch` | `string` |
| `source_spec_path` | `string` |
| `depends_on` | `string[]` |
| `vars` | `map` |

## Returns

`DispatchResult` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `session_id` | `string` |
| `slug` | `string` |
| `branch` | `string` |
| `resume` | `bool` |
| `studio_url` | `string` |
| `billing_warning` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.dispatch --json '{ "agent": "", "spec": "", "prompt": "", "resume": false, "harness": "", "model": "", "open_tab": false, "invocation": "", "keepalive": false, "workspace": "", "slug": "", "branch": "", "source_spec_path": "", "depends_on": [], "vars": {} }'
```

Kind: command.

